MODERN DESKTOP STYLE STANDARD (APP-DESKTOP-MODERN-STYLE) [QA]

================================================================================

All Nivo78 desktop applications (Windows, macOS, Linux desktop shells, Compose
Multiplatform Desktop, WinForms, WPF, etc.) must adhere to the Modern Desktop Style.
Detail: reference/NIVO78_DESKTOP_MENU_BAR.txt.

1. Standard Top Menu Bar (required)
- Family top menu on every desktop window (File, product menus, Help canonical order).
- MUST NOT ship toolbar-only chrome without this menu.

2. Optional Action Toolbar (high-frequency only)
- Below brand header when used; MUST NOT duplicate top-menu commands with the same outcome.

3. Global Keyboard Shortcut Preservation
- Shortcuts wired to menu commands (ProcessCmdKey / desktop key dispatcher).

4. Contextual In-Place Menus
- Row-level and selection-level operations (cut, copy, paste, delete row, insert
  from catalog/price book, move up/down) MUST be accessible via right-click
  context menus (ContextMenuStrip / Compose context menu) directly on the
  workspace data grid or list.

5. Brand Banner & Standard 80px Logo
- Desktop header features the product logo with standard 80px target height
  (targetHeightPx = 80 / 80.dp), scaled proportionally with high-quality rendering
  (preserving aspect ratio, anti-aliased, transparent background).
- Prominent bold product title (e.g. N78-Estimate, N78-Ops) alongside the clear
  one-line plain-language product utility subtitle/tagline.

6. High-Density Workspace & Docked Utility Panels
- Full-width workspace expansion with high-density data grids, compact inputs,
  alternating row shading, and clear financial/summary cards.
- Docked tool/viewer panels (CAD blueprint viewer, document viewer, preview panel)
  feature dark canvas theme, dedicated mini-toolbar controls (+, -, Fit, Float, X),
  and live zoom/pan status.

